# not from a tape — written for the app, so there is no v1 line to match.
@segment  announcement
@title    What This Session Is
@levels   F1
@verbosity 1
@duration ~25s
@from     F1

# Spoken before anything else, so the listener knows what they agreed to.
#
# [[tokens]] are filled at assembly from the session's own settings -- see
# SessionAnnouncement. The frame lives here, in a file, because the engine may
# not hardcode anything spoken; only the values come from data.
#
# Verbosity 1: says what was chosen and where you are going. Nothing else.

say This session is set to verbosity one. Anchors and counts, with room between them.
pause 4
say We are going to [[destination]].
pause 5
